    - target: {fileID: 1963447426254693402, guid: 67e37d9bfe6cf0843959ec09856e65b9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "In Texas, Americans moved in with Mexico\u2019s permission. They promised
        to follow the rules - no fighting, just settlement.\nOut west, Lewis and
        Clark explored new lands. Later, a path known as the South Pass made it easier
        for wagons to reach Oregon. As more settlers arrived, so did our claim. t"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
