    - target: {fileID: 4462542398792830543, guid: 67e37d9bfe6cf0843959ec09856e65b9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: I sent a man named James Monroe to buy New Orleans for our farmers.
        Napoleon and France surprised us - they sold us all of Louisiana instead!
        One peaceful deal doubled our country. t
